{"steam_appid":2357000,"steam_name":"KILL IT WITH FIRE! 2","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2357000/860566521/d9b21ac9ef6aa5776b227d326cde44b9780b9d39/1764029990/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764065271","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257237391/69ddca062b9757e354ccc19743d7c50b74663be1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764065271","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/5e8e66e51b515ebf1e8b28dcf9c1e725b6cf948f/ss_5e8e66e51b515ebf1e8b28dcf9c1e725b6cf948f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781540713","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/c8b57995db4dc964c02cc55212cf48c8704fec38/ss_c8b57995db4dc964c02cc55212cf48c8704fec38.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781540713","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/5fbb96c77b47d74c16349fca897e97e94301c5fb/ss_5fbb96c77b47d74c16349fca897e97e94301c5fb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781540713","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/0b418218c0bb5a10b1aee07fde65aaffe3ee99f2/ss_0b418218c0bb5a10b1aee07fde65aaffe3ee99f2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781540713","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/660c5443d33189db990c9a20e0242d1b63d3c25f/ss_660c5443d33189db990c9a20e0242d1b63d3c25f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1781540713"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.poster.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.webm?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/69e0d251b7e34b67b19cab4efacd404a.mp4?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Exterminator on a crusade against the spider horde taking over the multiverse. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with friends via online co-op for up to 4 players, blast through the story campaign, and show these pests who’s boss. Or, jump into a frenetic Humans vs Spiders PvP mode for some laughs and screams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you choose, one thing is certain – it’s time to KILL IT WITH FIRE!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/a8e46f7e19cfe78239a368b16a8d7f8c.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.poster.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.webm?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/12b872f73b449b08d15b7d0c9076e35e.mp4?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war on the eight-legged monsters with an arsenal of 45 weapons and gadgets worthy of the Exterminator. Will your team smash the pests with a newspaper, burn them to a crisp, rev up the minigun, unleash a rocket launcher, or wield a laser sword?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/7ff015d27210aff282ba3c0207fc5c9e.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=150 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.poster.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.webm?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/19fad8b051775741df6b670772078bf9.mp4?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic spider hunt across seven distinct worlds. Exterminate the pesky arachnids in a mysterious manor, liberate a town in the Wild West, explore cyberspace, and descend into Spider Hell. Every level is a unique battle against the spiders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6975991f694027638dd98b63b49dbc38.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.poster.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=660 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.webm?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/0192d665e94195c3947a43c51dd76b41.mp4?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew magic potions in a bubbling cauldron. Demolish a megapolis as a kaiju-sized madman. Defend a cacti-owned saloon from waves of spiders. Win a drone race in virtual reality. There are more than 60 challenges to complete!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/e734c20e77fd259369245410c25df211.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.poster.avif?t=1781540713\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.webm?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2357000/extras/6109feb7a36c865245871c2742b45d97.mp4?t=1781540713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >‘Okay, all this spider-hunting sounds fun, but what if I want to play as a spider?’ you might ask. And yes, you can indeed play as a spider in an online 8-player PvP mode called Spider Hunt. It’s actual humans vs actual arachnids (also controlled by humans)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 dimensions to save from the spider onslaught</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    60+ unique in-game challenges to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    45 weapons and gadgets to unlock and craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A campaign that’s fully playable solo or in 4-player co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Slapstick plot written by Miles Luna (RWBY, Red vs Blue)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    'Spider Hunt’ PvP multiplayer mode for up to 8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    20+ hours of content with at least 3 loud laughs guaranteed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    15.7 billion spiders to exterminate across the multiverse</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 760 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Check your fans for spider eggs</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.4 GHz Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 or Equivalent</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Casey Donnellan Games LLC"],"publishers":["tinyBuild"],"release_date":"25 Nov, 2025"}